  "details": "at VRChat Open Beta build:1029\nI have enabled the UseLowLatency option in the VRCAVProVideoPlayer, but there is a delay of 6 seconds.\nIn AVProVideo with SDK2, the delay is around 1 second when this setting is enabled.\nhttps://twitter.com/onotchi_/status/1337424867696656384\nI used 'TopazChat Streamer' for the streaming.\nThis is an application that streams audio only, often used for Japanese music live events on VRChat.\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/1756789\nFor testing, I used the following URL\nrtspt://topaz.chat/live/latencyTest\nwas received by the VideoPlayer.\nThe test was conducted in the world where the VideoPlayer bundled with SDK3 and the USharpVideoPlayer were put in place.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_49f3eb5f-11b0-46bf-8e72-9a9f8a8d97ee",
